title: Fold a fix into an earlier commit
title-zh: 把修正并入更早的提交
---
# A recipes repository with two commits
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+hidden pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
> git add pancakes.md
> git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
> git switch -c soups
+hidden soup.md
# Tomatoe soup

- 1 kg tomatoes
+end
> git add soup.md
> git commit -m "Add a tomato soup recipe"
+hidden bread.md
# Soda bread
+end
> git add bread.md
> git commit -m "Add a soda bread recipe"
$ git log --oneline
+file soup.md
# Tomato soup

- 1 kg tomatoes
+end
$ git add soup.md
$ git commit --fixup HEAD~1
$ git log --oneline
$ git rebase -i --autosquash main
$ git log --oneline
